# ── autogit per-project config ────────────────────────────────────────
# .env holds only GIT_REMOTE_URL (a public git URL, not a secret), so
# by default we let it travel with the repo — everyone who clones gets
# the right remote out of the box. Uncomment the line below if you keep
# local overrides (tokens, alternate remotes) in .env and don't want
# them committed.
# .env